  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Brown Sugar.png|200px|left|Brown sugar]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 7\n |price = 1 to 32\n |time = 20 min\n |xp = 4\n |source = {{Infoicon|SugarM|bigger|link=Sugar Mill}}\n |base = 9\n |dia = 2\n |time3 = 17 min\n}}\n'''Brown sugar''' is a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 7.\n\nIt is used as an ingredient in several other products, including [[cookie]]s and [[Tomato Sauce|tomato sauce]] which are then used in other recipes.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making brown sugar'''===\n[[File:Sugar Mill.png|150px|left|link=Sugar Mill|Sugar Mill]]\nBrown sugar is made in the [[Sugar Mill]].\n\nTo make brown sugar, players need the following ingredient, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Sugarcane.png|75px|Sugarcane|link=Sugarcane]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 20 minutes to make one bag of sugar, and 17 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] mill. Each bag gives players 4 {{Infoicon|xp}} points.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling brown sugar'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|link=Roadside Shop|Roadside Shop]]\n* Brown sugar can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 324 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 bags.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a bag costs 14 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Using brown sugar''' ===\nBrown sugar is used to make the following [[products]]:\n{{Ingredient usage|Brown Sugar\n|Pancake|1|9\n|Cookie|1|10\n|Carrot Cake|1|21\n|Chocolate Cake|1|36\n|Sesame Ice Cream|1|50\n|Egg Sushi|1|63\n|Tomato Sauce|1|69\n|Blueberry Chutney|1|70\n|Cream Donut|1|86\n}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|link=Boat|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders require 2 to 14 bags of brown sugar per crate, up to a total of 42 per boat.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* Although fewer recipes need brown sugar than they do white sugar, it is still a high-demand product in the game. You need to constantly produce some and make sure you have enough stored in your [[barn]].\n* You can't expect to find sugar in the [[Daily Dirt]]. Selling it, even at the maximum price, is not worth it. Make something with it, and sell those instead.\n* [[Brown Sugar]] is used to make a few intermediate products; for example, [[cookie]]s are used to make [[cheesecake]]s and [[Fried Candy Bar|fried candy bars]]\n----\n==='''Did you know?'''===\n* The label on the bag says 'Supasugar', like it does on [[White Sugar|white sugar]].\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Brauner Zucker\n|es = Azúcar moreno\n|fr = Sucre Roux\n|it = Zucchero di canna\n|nl = Bruine Suiker\n|no = Brunt sukker\n|zh = 红糖\n}}\n[[pt-br:Açúcar mascavo]]\n[[ru:Коричневый сахар]]\n\n[[Category:Sugar Mill Products]]\n[[Category:Sugarcane Products]]",
  "wikitextHash": "b6b03a4700cbad6e30514f3d01b6d01d26c8cbbb4171e95258ba8fc9f141b84c"
